  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The ghost flings his axe at Natsuki, which rebounds off of the walls.
  - The ghost throws his axe at Natsuki, recalling it back to himself through the
    air.
  - Natsuki manages to find herself in a tight space, which the ghost takes as an
    opportunity to throw his axe at her.
  - The ghost flings his axe at Natsuki from above, rebounding off of the floor.
  randomAttacks:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0787e91762c3504fa5c190265ef7cce, type: 2}
