  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37209b4816a629d43a9a0677ea250822, type: 2}
  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The ghost flings his axe from above. Again.
  - The ghost flings his axe at Natsuki, which rebounds off of the walls. Again.
  - The ghost throws his axe at a cornered Natsuki. Again.
